## Third-party map data

This license applies only to this project's original source code and
accompanying files. It does not apply to map tiles or other data fetched from
the Geospatial Information Authority of Japan (GSI), Google Earth Pro, Python,
Docker, or any other third-party product or service. Their respective terms
remain applicable.

This software fetches GSI standard map tiles from:
https://cyberjapandata.gsi.go.jp/xyz/std/{z}/{x}/{y}.png

When using GSI maps, follow GSI's attribution and usage requirements. Include
an attribution such as "出典：国土地理院" where appropriate. GSI states that
attribution is required even when an application is not required, and that
attribution should normally remain visible on a screen while map data is
displayed.

Use within a personal or otherwise access-restricted LAN may be less likely to
constitute providing copies to an unspecified number of people, but this
license does not determine whether an application or approval is required.
That determination depends on the actual use and is made under applicable GSI
rules. Confirm with GSI before public distribution, public access, or other
uses for which approval may be required.

Official information:
- https://www.gsi.go.jp/LAW/2930-index.html
- https://www.gsi.go.jp/LAW/2930-meizi.html
- https://maps.gsi.go.jp/development/ichiran.html
